<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle mostly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle mostly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers mostly steady, instances 1.00 higher on calves under 500 lbs.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers:  Medium and Large 1 300-400 lbs 80.00-86.50, some 90.00-94.00; 400-500 lbs 78.50-88.50, few blacks 87.50-90.00; 500-600 lbs 74.75-82.50; 600-700 lbs 75.00-80.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers: Medium and Large 1 300-400 lbs 75.00-83.00; 400-500 lbs 72.00-81.00; 500-600 lbs 70.00-78.75, package blacks 502 lbs 80.25.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
